From: mkinney <2219838+mkinney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:29:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(mcp): bound background work and detach blocked input
 on output failure

Keep cancelled jobs in the worker budget until completion. Bound queued input, route accepted generate forms through background dispatch, and return output errors without waiting for input EOF.

